WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:05.230
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:25.090
This is Sakuragi Park’s flower field.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:28.840
A place where everyone can relax,
full of flowers of many colors.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.530
Does that feel good?

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.400
Taking a shower is the best, right?

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:57.030
Ooh, are the Flabébé racing?!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.740
Looking good! Go for it!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.830
They evolved!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.380
Floette’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:19.760
Floette! Single Bloom Pokémon!
Fairy type!

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.540
It flutters around fields of flowers
and cares for flowers that are starting to wilt!

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.230
It draws out the power of flowers to battle!

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:32.020
All right, now I’ve got
all five colors of Floette as... well... Huh?

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.610
The white Flabébé is missing?

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.870
Hey! Where are you?

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.410
One of the petals is missing!

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.680
So that’s why she
couldn’t fly right...

00:01:58.220 --> 00:01:59.930
What do we do, Go?

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:03.110
We don’t have a choice.
We have to find her a new flower!

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.170
You’re right. But where?

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.100
I don’t think there’s any here...

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.310
I caught them in Kalos,
so there must be flowers there!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.570
It’ll be okay, Flabébé.
I’ll find you a new flower.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.260
So, to find Flabébé a new flower...

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.340
Let’s go to Kalos!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.550
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.340
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.850
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:47.720
And skip the slow send-off

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:50.230
Be it through fire or through water

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.850
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:57.780
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:02.780
Each and every one of my memories

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:07.290
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.710
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:17.210
I've got my plans for when I grow up in my pocket

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:23.430
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:27.680
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.020
Let's have a fight!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.430
1. Once the battle's done

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:33.560
2. And we're laughing or crying

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:38.320
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:44.410
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:49.660
With this unpredictable, unfathomable world awaiting

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.080
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:56.250
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.000
I choose you!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:08.020
Flabébé's White Flower

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:11.270
Shala City, Kalos Region

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.770
I think the spot I caught them
was around here...

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:22.010
Flabébé,
where do your white flowers grow?

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.300
Oh, hold on!

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.490
That one isn’t safe to fly with.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:36.530
Riding on a flower must
really make her wanna fly...

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:37.440
Yeah.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.300
So I’ll look after your flower.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.530
Huh?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.010
What’s going on?

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:57.020
Maybe she feels at home up there?
She even has something to hold onto.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.220
Huh? Do you?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.780
Hey... What are you...?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.610
It’s like she’s telling you to “Go!”

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:08.860
I get it!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.990
So you’re controlling me
like you would a flower...

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.210
Okay...

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:16.000
Whoa!
My body is moving on its own!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.440
Looking good, Flabébé.
Keep going!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.550
Wah!
Where could I be going?!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.800
Ow!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:35.390
Sarunori,
you’re pulling too hard!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.650
Stop!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:44.820
Oh, is this it?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.070
Don’t tell me...

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:53.700
The spot where your flower grew
is under this rock?!

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:06.880
Never would’ve expected that
they’d be flattened under a rock...

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.570
There weren’t any white flowers
nearby either...

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.230
Guess we gotta try somewhere else.

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:16.520
We’ve only just started looking.
Cheer up, yeah?

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.300
Hey, Flabébé.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.780
Would you like to have
some honey?

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:24.950
It tastes good!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.330
She’s laughing!

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:58.700
I see... That must’ve been
a disappointment.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.490
Director Sakuragi,
do you know any other place they grow?

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:09.640
The thing is, white Flabébé are rare,
so unfortunately, their flowers are hard to find.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.250
I see...

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.200
Either way, I’ll try looking into it.
I’ll call you if I discover anything.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.460
That would be great.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:20.640
This might be harder than I thought...

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:22.410
But we’ve gotta do it!

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.130
Yeah.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:26.500
We should try and find some on our own.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.120
Yeah!

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:40.830
Flabébé?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.720
Where are you going?

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.140
Figures you’d have trouble sleeping...

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:03.770
There’s something nice about
the air at night, isn’t there?

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.830
It’s not like during the day.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.380
Like... It feels special.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.710
You want to go for
a little walk?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:32.320
Today, we’re gonna look everywhere
for Flabébé’s white flowers!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.320
Yeah! We’ll find them for sure!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.570
Hey, Go!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.320
How about this one?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.090
No luck,
even with all our searching...

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.510
There were plenty that
<i>looked</i> right...

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:35.600
But Flabébé must be able
to tell the difference.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.100
Maybe we should go back to the Institute,
and try and come up with ideas...

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:49.850
Here.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.490
She’s getting used to your head.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:55.750
Guess so.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:59.360
Flabébé looks quite comfortable
up there, too...

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.410
So don’t worry, Flabébé.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:08.470
Until we find you a flower—no, even if we never find one,
you’ll always have a home on my head!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.030
Then maybe someday
you’ll start flying like a flower!

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.330
That’d be awesome!

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.320
Oww...

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.290
That’s right.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:16.110
Even if it’s no problem for me,
you’ve been suffering...

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.990
Tomorrow,
we’ll find you a new flower for sure!

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.450
Pocket Monsters!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:48.430
All that happened...?

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.420
Sorry, I had no idea.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.700
It <i>was</i> late at night.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:57.650
That reminds me, I went for a walk with Flabébé
the previous night, too.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.340
Do you like nighttime
or something?

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.530
Director Sakuragi!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.160
Did you discover anything?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:10.160
Yes. I managed to contact someone
who knows about Flabébé’s white flowers.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.130
All right!

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.160
So?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.960
She researches plants.
I’ll send you her location.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.550
Hello!

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:20.380
Welcome!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.800
You must’ve had quite the long trip
to get here.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.060
Professor Sakuragi
told me everything.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.430
Florges!
That’s Flabébé’s final evolution.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:33.370
Florges! Garden Pokémon!
Fairy type!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:40.320
In times long past, governors of castles would invite Florges
to create flower gardens to embellish the castle domains!

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:49.450
Don’t worry. Just watch.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.820
That was... Grass Field?

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:22.540
Yes. She can give energy to the plants
by doing that.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.860
Flabébé looks really happy.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:30.250
They are both species that love flowers,
and live alongside them.

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:34.100
It’s said that Flabébé are drawn to flowers,
Floette tend to flowers,

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:38.450
and Florges devote their lives to
protecting flower gardens.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:51.990
Actually, that Florges once lost
her orange flower, too.

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:58.480
They’re about as rare as the white flowers are,
so finding one was quite the task.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:03.460
She must have taken interest in your Flabébé,
seeing her facing a similar plight.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.990
These are Florges’ flowers.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:10.420
It seems these plants
are prone to stunted growth,

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:14.240
and they don’t propagate much,
even with Florges’ help.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:23.250
I... I want to find Flabébé
a white flower too!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:30.090
About that, a researcher friend of mine reported
seeing a cluster of white flowers...

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.760
...deep in the mountains
northwest of here.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.460
A cluster of them?!

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:36.480
Best of luck finding them.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.230
Right! Thank you!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.580
Good news, huh, Flabébé?

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.360
I’m sure we’ll find them this time.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.250
Oh, is that Grass Field?

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.310
I see you’re copying Florges.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:59.250
She must’ve really liked it!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:03.080
You’ll just have to make your own
flower garden someday, then!

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:24.480
They should be somewhere around here...
But I don’t see anywhere they could be.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:29.190
Pikachu, they’re white flowers, you hear?
Lemme know if you see any.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:36.980
Did you find them?!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.500
Those are pink...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.990
Yeah...

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:45.770
Let’s look over there.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:46.610
Yeah.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:59.840
We didn’t see a single flower,
let alone a cluster...

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:02.480
She <i>did</i> say they have
a tough time growing...

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:10.420
Maybe something happened to
the flowers here, too...

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.520
What?

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.600
She says she wants to
go that way.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.670
But that’ll just be
going backwards...

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.720
Owww!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.130
Okay, okay!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.510
The flowers we saw earlier...

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:43.270
But they’re pink, not white.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:10.790
The pink buds bloom
into white flowers at night...

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.550
So that’s it!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:22.220
Go on, get on.

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.360
You did it, Flabébé!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.490
You got a white flower!

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:42.680
Huh?

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.020
There’s another one...

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:45.120
She’s not riding a flower.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.500
Is she choosing a flower
for the first time?

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.240
Take care!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.060
Right.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:30.600
But now,
there’s just one flower left.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:33.650
Yeah. I hope there’s
more of them somewhere...

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.900
But what if they all get wiped out?

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.070
That’s...

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.750
Grass Field?!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.060
She evolved into Floette!

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:16.420
Floette...

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.030
You did it! That’s Grass Field!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.140
That was amazing, Floette!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:46.640
It’s said that Flabébé are drawn to flowers,
Floette tend to flowers,

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:50.920
and Florges devote their lives to
protecting flower gardens.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:56.190
You’ll just have to make your own
flower garden someday, then!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:05.900
I get it. You want to stay here
and protect the white flowers, don’t you?

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.640
Go...

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:15.290
If that’s your choice,
I’ll support you.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.930
I can’t let the flowers you treasure
be wiped out, can I?

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.890
That’s far enough, Floette.

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:34.970
Thanks for the send-off.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.480
Do a good job out there!

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.250
Take care, then...

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:51.000
Sarunori really likes Floette...

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.980
So do I, Sarunori...

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.560
That’s why we have to
say goodbye for now.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.190
So Floette can do her best!

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.850
Then someday,
we’ll come and visit.

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:06.900
And see your beautiful garden
of white flowers.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.440
Okay?

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:14.830
See you, Floette!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.630
Go and Satoshi bore witness
to Flabébé’s growth.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:42.160
Through meetings and farewells,
their adventure still continues.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.500
Let's play Pokémon Shiritori

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:10.190
Shiritori set to Pokémon Techno

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:13.520
Chain the names of Pokémon

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:16.530
If it ends in an “N”, you lose

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:20.150
Okay, let's go one more time!

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:47.310
Shiritori with the Music Club

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:50.560
Chain the names of Pokémon

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:53.680
Learn lots of Pokémon names

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:57.190
All right! Now you're set for success!

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:09.580
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:10.860
Go!

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:12.910
Whaaaaat?!

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:14.490
Pikachu got arrested?!

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.540
Electricity was stolen?!

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:24.960
If it wasn’t Pikachu, then there must be
someone else behind it!

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:28.800
You two...
Will you help me investigate?

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:29.570
Sure!

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.340
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.500
Pikachu the Suspect?!
